    {
      "id": "p0115-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because Papyrus' text uses the Papyrus font in the English version of Undertale, the localization team considered giving Papyrus a new name to match his new Japanese vertical text. Thus, for only a few weeks during the game's localization, Papyrus was known as \"Taterus\" - a combination of the Japanese word tate (\"vertical\") and \"Papyrus\". This name didn't last long, however, because it sounded too forced and not very funny.",
        "raw": "Because Papyrus' text uses the Papyrus font in the English version of Undertale,\nthe localization team considered giving Papyrus a new name to match his\nnew Japanese vertical text. Thus, for only a few weeks during the game's\nlocalization, Papyrus was known as \"Taterus\" - a combination of the Japanese\nword tate (\"vertical\") and \"Papyrus\". This name didn't last long, however,\nbecause it sounded too forced and not very funny.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09112884,
          0.25094286,
          0.70457825,
          0.35485
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08297461,
          0.25022857,
          0.70662448,
          0.35592143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          18,
          19,
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "由于英语版 Undertale 中 Papyrus 使用 Papyrus 字体，本地化团队考虑给他起个新名字，来配合日文的竖排台词。于是，在本地化过程中的短短几周里，Papyrus 被叫作“Taterus”：由日语 tate（竖向）与“Papyrus”组合而成。但这个名字听起来太牵强，也不太好笑，所以没用多久就放弃了。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 15,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 108,
